			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Output and Sky CHANGELOG rewrites\n\nSynchronize the Element submodule to 2ba444be, bringing in downstream updates to Output (471479a2→214a9ffb) and Sky (7fa66748→f87442b0) with restructured CHANGELOG documentation.\n\n- Output: Rewrite CHANGELOG to document v2.x release chain, adding v2.2 (ExposeWorkbenchAccessor transform, service-IIFE wrapping, Mountain→Cocoon buffer decoding), v2.1 (polyfill hardening, IPC adapter), and v2.0 (source compilation migration) sections.\n- Sky: Rewrite CHANGELOG.md with improved formatting and v2.2 entries documenting the bundled-electron correctness pass including sky:replay-events, channel-event bridge for terminal PTY, and search-result format migration to VS Code ≥1.92 schema.\n\nEnsures consistent prose-style CHANGELOG format across all Land project components.",
