			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Cocoon CHANGELOG updates\n\nSynchronize the Element submodule to 393741b5, bringing in Cocoon's CHANGELOG documentation that matches Mountain's prose format. The v2.2 section documents the bundled-electron correctness pass: parent-PID watchdog for orphan detection, -32004 benign-404 classification, FileWatcher.Register benign classifier, and UTF-8 decoding fix for npm extension scripts.\n\nHistorical entries (v2.1 through v1.1) have been converted from bullet points to narrative paragraphs explaining architectural motivation and impact. This ensures consistent CHANGELOG style across all Land project components following the recent monorepo-wide prose format migration.",
